[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3690758592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114328#issuecomment-3690758592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114328","id":3690758592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b_IHA","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-25T02:29:38Z","updated_at":"2025-12-25T02:29:38Z","body":"cc @Rindbee (#60143)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3690758592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691486815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114328#issuecomment-3691486815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114328","id":3691486815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cB55f","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-25T14:21:41Z","updated_at":"2025-12-25T14:21:41Z","body":"I've realized this is not a proper fix, this would break for a runtime duplication of a Node with source binded using `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` (which is broken even before this PR as binds including the source Node would be duplicated but without retargetting the binded source to be relative to the duplicated-new-node if possible).\r\n\r\n`CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` seems to be broken / half-baked in general, as e.g. connecting to a signal with `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` flag does not bind the source on runtime, only when saving to a PackedScene. This leads to bugs/inconsistencies.\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorScript\r\n\r\nclass Signaler:\r\n\tsignal sig\r\n\r\nclass Receiver:\r\n\tfunc callback(source: Object) -> void:\r\n\t\tprint(\"%s.callback( source=%s )\" % [self, source])\r\n\r\nfunc _run() -> void:\r\n\tvar source := Signaler.new()\r\n\tvar receiver := Receiver.new()\r\n\r\n\tsource.sig.connect(receiver.callback, CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT)\r\n\tsource.sig.emit() # ERROR: core/object/object.cpp:1310 - Error calling from signal 'sig' to callable: 'RefCounted::callback': Method expected 1 argument(s), but called with 0.\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691486815/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691510307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114328#issuecomment-3691510307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114328","id":3691510307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cB_oj","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-25T14:50:17Z","updated_at":"2025-12-25T15:01:53Z","body":"> `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` seems to be broken / half-baked in general, as e.g. connecting to a signal with `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` flag does not bind the source on runtime, only when saving to a PackedScene. \r\n\r\n`CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` is currently a flag primarily used for `PackedScene` and is somewhat redundant ~~now~~. It was originally intended to enhance the functionality of the connection dialog, ~~but the ability to add extra parameters of type `NodePath` (`^\".\"`) now effectively replaces this functionality.~~ ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691510307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3692767881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114328#issuecomment-3692767881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114328","id":3692767881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cGyqJ","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T12:00:33Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T12:00:33Z","body":"> `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` is currently a flag primarily used for `PackedScene` and is somewhat redundant ~now~. It was originally intended to enhance the functionality of the connection dialog, ~but the ability to add extra parameters of type `NodePath` (`^\".\"`) now effectively replaces this functionality.~\r\n\r\nI've moved handling `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` to Object / removed special handling from PackedScene. PR description updated.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3692767881/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3770441782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114328#issuecomment-3770441782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114328","id":3770441782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gvGA2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T23:34:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T23:34:04Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3770441782/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"l